	(gr_text_box "JP5 EA:\n8039: set EA to +5V (external ROM).\n8048: set EA to GND (internal ROM).\n\nJP6 POWER:\n1–2: power from FTDI VCC.\n2–3: power from J2 pin 18.\nFIT ONE POWER JUMPER ONLY."
